WEBVTT

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:05.630
Uh, hello, Kosaka-san?

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.580
Yes, it's completely fine, but... What happened?

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:12.380
Huh? Your dad?!

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:16.130
Yes. This morning, he suddenly had body pain...

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:18.580
My mother is taking him to the hospital now.

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:22.040
So in regards to today's date...

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:24.250
Oh no, I'm alright with that.

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:26.630
Moreover, is there any way I can help?

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:30.040
No, there's no other pressing matter besides that.

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:32.580
Where is it that your father got hurt?

00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:34.580
Well, his lower back...

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:35.420
Lower back?

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:36.080
Yes.

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:37.210
According to my mother,

00:00:37.210 --> 00:00:39.960
it's because he used it too much last night.

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:42.500
Super-exciting!

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.540
I-I see...

00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:47.420
Well then, please give my kind regards to your father.

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:49.750
I really do apologize. Good bye.

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:53.130
It's a shame, but nothing I can do.

00:00:53.130 --> 00:00:55.630
Okay, what should I do now, then?

00:00:56.630 --> 00:00:58.080
Oh! That you, Haru?!

00:00:58.080 --> 00:00:58.790
Huh?

00:01:00.670 --> 00:01:02.500
Haru!

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:03.500
Sis?!

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:38.330
Huh?

00:02:39.420 --> 00:02:40.710
Are you alone today?

00:02:40.710 --> 00:02:41.460
Y-yeah.

00:02:42.380 --> 00:02:44.670
Oh, is that so...

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:46.540
Then let's walk around together!

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:48.540
Y-you're too close!

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:49.960
What?

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:52.130
So is this close okay?

00:02:52.130 --> 00:02:53.080
N-no way!

00:02:53.290 --> 00:02:55.040
Then how about this close?

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:56.540
It's all too close.

00:02:56.670 --> 00:02:59.460
It tends to get hot when you're close together, right?

00:02:59.460 --> 00:03:01.290
And we're already in the depths of summer...

00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:06.130
Oh my... The family diner that I was just at
made me so chilly!

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:09.000
Do you want me to hold you tight?

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:11.540
No, that will just make it hotter.

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:14.330
If I hold you tight, your lower half will get hot t-

00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:18.790
See?

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:20.830
It really only made you hot.

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:22.380
W-what is it?!

00:03:22.380 --> 00:03:24.580
It's just that your hand is hot!

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:25.580
Is that so?

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:26.670
Jeez!

00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:28.670
Whatever, just come with me!

00:03:28.670 --> 00:03:30.250
S-Sis?!

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:35.540
Ta-da!

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:39.880
You meant come with you to go shopping, huh?

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:43.250
Whatcha think? Doesn't the mature charm
of an adult make you giddy?

00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:45.460
Well, if I had to say, isn't this a bit childish?

00:03:46.210 --> 00:03:47.460
Next is this one!

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:49.420
It'll make you even giddier!

00:03:49.670 --> 00:03:51.130
A one-piece dress, huh?

00:03:51.130 --> 00:03:53.330
Hm, Haru...

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:54.170
Yeah?

00:03:54.170 --> 00:03:56.750
Help me with the hook on the back.

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:58.130
Sure, okay.

00:03:58.540 --> 00:03:59.670
Okay, I'm coming in.

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:02.170
Help me...

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:03.670
with my bra hook.

00:04:03.670 --> 00:04:04.790
WHAT?!

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:06.040
When did you strip to your bra?!

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:07.420
You let your guard down!

00:04:07.420 --> 00:04:08.880
Put a top on!

00:04:09.830 --> 00:04:11.830
This time I'm trying on a swimsuit!

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:13.460
Th-then

00:04:13.460 --> 00:04:15.210
I'm going to wait outside.

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:16.750
What, why?

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:19.000
Are you embarrassed?

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:21.790
Because you're a child seeing me in a swimsuit, huh?

00:04:21.790 --> 00:04:23.380
You're wrong, that isn't why!

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:27.710
Then there's no problem
with me showing you my swimsuit, right?

00:04:27.710 --> 00:04:29.040
Wait, Sis...!

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:32.290
Miss, I have your A-cup right here!

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:37.040
Um! R-right now, I have company here,
so the size is... well...

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:38.700
That's why I was trying to be careful...

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:42.580
Where did Sis go?

00:04:43.790 --> 00:04:46.830
Hmm, maybe I'll buy this.

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:48.830
What is she hesitating about?

00:04:51.670 --> 00:04:53.250
Whaaaaaaaat?!

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:54.670
I've decided!

00:04:54.670 --> 00:04:55.420
Huh?!

00:04:55.420 --> 00:04:56.330
Haru...

00:04:56.330 --> 00:04:57.790
I'm gonna buy it!

00:04:58.670 --> 00:05:00.420
As my snack!

00:05:00.420 --> 00:05:02.710
Why do you have it over there?!

00:05:07.710 --> 00:05:08.670
Spicy!

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:11.580
You're still a bit young for that, huh?

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:15.960
Next time we come here,
you'll decide on the mild one, right?

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:18.250
You're treating me like a child again.

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:21.380
Because in my eyes, you're a child.

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:23.580
Yeah, but...

00:05:23.580 --> 00:05:24.380
Hm?

00:05:24.830 --> 00:05:27.000
Your cooking is so delicious...

00:05:27.210 --> 00:05:29.710
simply eating it makes me happy.

00:05:32.710 --> 00:05:35.790
Wow, your face is so red...

00:05:35.790 --> 00:05:38.500
You were trying to tolerate the spice too, huh?

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:39.230
Shut up.

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:40.750
Shut up.

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:42.790
Haru! Let's watch a movie next!

00:05:42.790 --> 00:05:43.830
Which one do you wanna see?

00:05:43.830 --> 00:05:45.630
H-how long are we gonna hang out?

00:05:45.710 --> 00:05:51.210
I mean I haven't seen you at all
since the school camping trip...

00:05:51.210 --> 00:05:56.790
It made me feel so lonely then, the whole entire time!

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:58.920
I'm gonna stay like this until you say you'll do it!

00:05:58.920 --> 00:05:59.080
Fluffy, fluffy, fluffy...

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:01.880
Fine! I'll do it! I'll do it, okay?!

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:04.130
Excuse me,

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:05.500
two please!

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:07.290
Yes, ma'am.

00:06:07.290 --> 00:06:09.500
Would you like the couple's discount?

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:10.040
Huh?

00:06:10.040 --> 00:06:11.460
Uh, no! A student discount!

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:13.420
Thank you.

00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:16.240
We caused a misunderstanding, huh?

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:18.900
Jeez, it's because you're always clinging to me!

00:06:22.330 --> 00:06:24.710
That was fun!

00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:26.040
O-oh really?

00:06:26.330 --> 00:06:27.500
Oh, I know!

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:29.830
Hey! Do you want to come over to my house now?

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:31.540
I'm already done for today.

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:32.290
I'm exhausted.

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:34.460
Don't say that.

00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:37.170
I'll make you a delicious dinner!

00:06:37.170 --> 00:06:38.380
Huh?

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:40.750
Besides...

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:45.130
my mom and dad aren't home today.

00:06:45.290 --> 00:06:46.630
Huh?

00:06:46.790 --> 00:06:48.080
So...

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:51.960
You know what that means, don't you?

00:06:54.380 --> 00:06:55.830
Okay, sounds good.

00:06:55.830 --> 00:06:56.750
Huh?

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:59.830
If it's really that easy I'm not so interested...

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:01.250
I mean, Sis...

00:07:01.250 --> 00:07:03.500
It's lonely all by yourself, right?

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:04.580
Huh?!

00:07:06.460 --> 00:07:07.920
Wh-what's up with you?!

00:07:07.920 --> 00:07:11.380
You're being so audacious! Jerk, jerk, jerk!

00:07:11.670 --> 00:07:13.420
Super-exciting!

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:14.880
Wait, okay?

00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:16.830
I'm gonna go change!

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:20.580
I ultimately ended up here.

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:21.920
But,

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:24.290
Sis looks happy somehow...

00:07:24.670 --> 00:07:27.080
Doing this on occasion isn't so bad, I guess.

00:07:28.750 --> 00:07:29.960
Huh?! What's that?!

00:07:29.960 --> 00:07:31.000
Haru!

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:32.670
Help me!

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:34.330
S-Sis?!

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:40.790
Haru...

00:07:40.790 --> 00:07:42.630
you came for me!

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:44.250
Sis, are you okay?

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:46.580
What in the world is this?

00:07:46.830 --> 00:07:47.750
It can't be...

00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:49.290
A robbery?!

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:55.080
I thought it would be fun if we were linked together,
so I was testing out the handcuffs...

00:07:55.080 --> 00:07:58.420
but the key disappeared!

00:07:58.420 --> 00:08:00.460
Sis, is your head okay?

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:02.830
I was worried over nothing, you know.

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:05.330
But, is this where the key disappeared?

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:06.290
Yeah...

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:08.170
Then, I'm going to look for it a bit.

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:09.540
Haru, wait!

00:08:09.540 --> 00:08:10.580
What?

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:13.670
I-I gotta pee...

00:08:13.670 --> 00:08:14.670
Huh?

00:08:14.670 --> 00:08:16.290
I'm gonna wet myself!

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:17.210
Whoa!

00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:18.540
Just hold it a little longer!

00:08:18.790 --> 00:08:20.040
Open the door!

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:20.670
Got it!

00:08:20.670 --> 00:08:22.080
Sit me down!

00:08:22.080 --> 00:08:22.790
Got it!

00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:24.540
Gimme a kiss...

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:26.500
You lost me.

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:29.580
That's strange.

00:08:29.580 --> 00:08:32.080
Did you really drop the key in that room?

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:33.960
I suspect so...

00:08:33.960 --> 00:08:36.460
I wonder why we can't find it...

00:08:36.630 --> 00:08:40.790
Hey, hey, more importantly, I'm hungry!
Make some dinner!

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:43.790
Weren't you supposed to make dinner?

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:45.290
It's fine, it's fine!

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:49.000
I feel I've been skillfully screwed...

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:49.630
Hm?

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:53.290
There sure are a whole lot of vegetables.

00:08:53.710 --> 00:08:55.630
Is this tonight's main dish?

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:57.580
That's right, however...

00:08:57.790 --> 00:09:00.790
it might be eaten by the OTHER mouth...

00:09:00.920 --> 00:09:02.810
I'll go ahead and mince all of these then, okay?

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:05.210
Thanks for the meal!

00:09:06.460 --> 00:09:08.080
Brush my teeth!

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:09.670
I gotta do that too?!

00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:13.130
I mean, I can't brush them myself...

00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:15.790
Since you can hold it properly...

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:17.250
right?

00:09:17.420 --> 00:09:20.420
I'm tired of doing all this for her now...

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:45.630
Huh. This keeps her quiet, so maybe it's kinda good.

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:48.830
Maybe it's alright that he looks at me
with such frosty eyes.

00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:49.880
Wow...

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:50.880
Heh.

00:09:51.080 --> 00:09:52.830
I'm so sweaty today,

00:09:52.830 --> 00:09:54.710
I have to wash properly.

00:09:54.710 --> 00:09:56.380
Huh? "Wash"?!

00:09:59.460 --> 00:10:00.750
Hey...

00:10:01.420 --> 00:10:02.710
Wash me?

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:05.000
Make sure you don't...

00:10:05.670 --> 00:10:07.250
hurt me.

00:10:10.830 --> 00:10:11.790
No, no, no!

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:13.290
I absolutely can't go that far!

00:10:13.290 --> 00:10:16.000
I have Kosaka-san, plus doing THAT in the bath?!

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:17.000
Huh?

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:18.920
I'm talking about the washing machine, though...

00:10:19.210 --> 00:10:19.960
Huh?

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:21.000
Huh?

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:23.290
What's this?!

00:10:23.290 --> 00:10:25.170
What did you think I was talking about?!

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:25.730
Huh?

00:10:25.730 --> 00:10:25.830
Huh?
Huh?

00:10:25.830 --> 00:10:26.250
Huh?

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:26.350
Huh?
Huh?

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:26.680
Huh?

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:26.780
HUH?!
Huh?

00:10:26.780 --> 00:10:27.420
HUH?!

00:10:27.420 --> 00:10:27.600
Shut up.
HUH?!

00:10:27.600 --> 00:10:28.420
Shut up.

00:10:28.880 --> 00:10:30.830
Carry me to my room.

00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:32.040
Okay, okay.

00:10:32.290 --> 00:10:34.710
Carrying the beloved princess!

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:36.880
Okay then, here we go.

00:10:36.880 --> 00:10:39.210
Alright. Be gentle...

00:10:42.880 --> 00:10:44.830
Huh? What's wrong?

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:46.580
Nothing.

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:50.080
I was just selfishly hopeful...

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:51.540
Huh?

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:54.630
You'll catch a chill in those clothes, won't you?

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:55.830
Oh...

00:10:55.830 --> 00:10:57.670
Thanks.

00:10:59.540 --> 00:11:02.080
When you help me out like this...

00:11:02.080 --> 00:11:04.380
I remember things from a long time ago.

00:11:04.380 --> 00:11:05.380
Huh?

00:11:05.380 --> 00:11:10.420
Like, when I stayed the night at your house,
and you comforted me.

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:11.670
Wow,

00:11:11.670 --> 00:11:13.080
you really remember.

00:11:13.960 --> 00:11:17.580
Papa... Mama...

00:11:20.540 --> 00:11:21.540
Sis...

00:11:21.540 --> 00:11:22.750
Are you crying?

00:11:27.420 --> 00:11:29.170
There, there...

00:11:35.330 --> 00:11:37.040
That did happen, didn't it...

00:11:38.380 --> 00:11:41.960
Well, after that, I also cheered you up.

00:11:41.960 --> 00:11:44.040
Sympathy tears!

00:11:44.040 --> 00:11:45.420
Forget about that part...

00:11:46.540 --> 00:11:50.580
But we've both changed a lot
compared to back then, huh?

00:11:50.580 --> 00:11:51.830
Think so?

00:11:52.830 --> 00:11:55.330
I think you haven't changed at all...

00:11:55.960 --> 00:11:57.960
...at least not your kindness!

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:00.630
Sis...

00:12:00.920 --> 00:12:03.330
I always appreciate that. Really.

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:05.540
Thanks, Haru.

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:07.380
Y-yeah...

00:12:07.380 --> 00:12:10.960
Next time you want to sweet-talk me,
will you not do it like that?

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:13.580
That's not what I'm doing!

00:12:13.580 --> 00:12:15.960
Guess I can't do anything about it.

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:24.290
Anyway, let's find the key for the handcuffs.

00:12:26.210 --> 00:12:27.080
Hm?

00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:28.830
What? Sis?!

00:12:29.920 --> 00:12:32.710
The bulge in that pocket
couldn't possibly be the key, right?!

00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:35.710
No way it's in a place like that...

00:12:35.920 --> 00:12:36.880
You little...

00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:38.380
Sorry, sorry!

00:12:38.380 --> 00:12:40.170
Hey, can you get it for me?

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:41.960
Fine, fine.

00:12:42.670 --> 00:12:45.460
Hey, no, Haru!

00:12:47.290 --> 00:12:48.460
Don't!

00:12:48.750 --> 00:12:54.380
If you stick it in there so suddenly...

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:59.250
I...

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:01.130
Can't!

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:04.750
Enough! Just shut up!

00:13:06.040 --> 00:13:06.920
Dammit.

00:13:06.920 --> 00:13:09.040
Don't you like it?

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:14.000
I told you, not so suddenly!!

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:19.170
I must do something for Shinozaki-san

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:21.960
in apology for our missed date yesterday...

00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:25.170
Huh? Sis, why do you have a cookbook with you?

00:13:25.170 --> 00:13:26.460
Oh, this?

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:30.380
The voices of Shinozaki-san and Ariyama-senpai?

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:33.920
I did lots of studying.

00:13:34.210 --> 00:13:37.460
We have a cooking class tomorrow
so I was using this for reference.

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:39.630
So the third-years are doing that tomorrow too...

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:41.830
Actually, we're doing the same thing.

00:13:41.830 --> 00:13:45.040
The task is making a meal for a lunch box, right?

00:13:45.210 --> 00:13:48.330
Cooking is not my specialty, so I'm worried...

00:13:48.460 --> 00:13:49.460
Flash.

00:13:50.710 --> 00:13:53.580
This is an apology from me.

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:56.000
You made this for me?!

00:13:57.830 --> 00:14:01.540
Maybe I'll make my special Hamburg steak...

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:04.630
Oh! Your steak is delicious!

00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:08.380
If only you could be there for me...

00:14:08.500 --> 00:14:09.630
Flash.

00:14:10.630 --> 00:14:13.580
Haru! I made Hamburg steak!

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:16.790
This one looks even more delicious!

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:20.960
I have to do something!

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:25.670
Phew!

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:28.880
I can't believe I read through a hundred cookbooks.

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:33.960
After all, a girlfriend that can be depended on
to cook well is a necessity for a boyfriend!

00:14:34.330 --> 00:14:36.210
This attempted appeal

00:14:36.210 --> 00:14:38.540
smells just like something Kanata would do.

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:40.330
A-amazing!

00:14:40.330 --> 00:14:41.830
I'm looking forward to this...

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:43.880
For Shinozaki-san,

00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:45.420
only the best...

00:14:45.630 --> 00:14:46.880
lunch box will...

00:14:47.540 --> 00:14:49.080
be provided!

00:14:49.460 --> 00:14:50.790
Whoa.

00:14:51.380 --> 00:14:52.750
Two eggs,

00:14:53.000 --> 00:14:54.710
a heaping tablespoon of sugar,

00:14:54.710 --> 00:14:56.750
a half-teaspoon of soy sauce.

00:14:57.170 --> 00:14:59.130
Pour that into a frying pan,

00:14:59.250 --> 00:15:01.420
and cook it thoroughly!

00:15:02.290 --> 00:15:04.380
The rolled omelet is done!

00:15:04.830 --> 00:15:07.330
And that is still true on a totally different level.

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:08.830
Fin.

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:10.540
P-please don't worry!

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:12.500
I'm good at cooking!

00:15:12.500 --> 00:15:14.540
I'm good...at cooking! I'm...good...!

00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:16.580
She's awfully enthusiastic today...

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:20.750
I wonder why? I hope she doesn't hurt herself.

00:15:21.290 --> 00:15:22.500
Shinozaki-kun...

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:25.000
The tip is twitching.

00:15:25.920 --> 00:15:29.170
Do you want me to teach you how to use it?

00:15:29.170 --> 00:15:30.500
Hoshikawa-kun...

00:15:31.920 --> 00:15:34.130
See, you do this...

00:15:34.130 --> 00:15:37.630
Be a little more gentle with it...

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:39.790
I-if this continues...

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:42.460
Do you understand?

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:45.790
A knife is for peeling back the skin, right?

00:15:45.790 --> 00:15:48.170
Would you peel my skin for me too?

00:15:48.290 --> 00:15:50.630
Yet another strange development!

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:51.210
Hm?

00:15:52.920 --> 00:15:54.460
This is bad!

00:15:54.460 --> 00:15:56.330
Huh? What is?

00:15:58.000 --> 00:15:59.000
Whoops...

00:15:59.420 --> 00:16:01.130
It's dangerous to go there.

00:16:01.130 --> 00:16:01.830
But...!

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:03.420
Ah, right there!

00:16:03.710 --> 00:16:07.290
Right there! Right there!

00:16:08.580 --> 00:16:12.080
Hey, no! Ah, hurry up!

00:16:12.130 --> 00:16:14.420
Sh..Shinozaki-san...

00:16:14.420 --> 00:16:16.960
Hey, like that, like that!

00:16:19.380 --> 00:16:21.750
It's on fire!

00:16:21.750 --> 00:16:24.130
Climax?!

00:16:25.210 --> 00:16:29.080
I can't believe he was eaten before eating!

00:16:29.080 --> 00:16:31.130
Kosaka-san! Fire! Fire!

00:16:31.540 --> 00:16:33.170
Cheer up!

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:40.210
This was made with confidence...

00:16:40.210 --> 00:16:42.040
It surpasses delicious...

00:16:42.040 --> 00:16:43.580
Is that self-hypnosis?!

00:16:47.250 --> 00:16:49.250
This texture! The taste!

00:16:49.250 --> 00:16:51.000
It's just like a marshmallow!

00:16:51.000 --> 00:16:52.080
Isn't that wrong?

00:16:52.250 --> 00:16:53.670
Akiho-chan!

00:16:53.670 --> 00:16:55.290
Are you finished?

00:16:55.750 --> 00:16:56.790
Rina-san.

00:16:57.210 --> 00:16:59.670
How about... a taste?

00:16:59.670 --> 00:17:02.380
My, is it okay?

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:03.670
It was made with confidence.

00:17:03.670 --> 00:17:05.670
Then, gladly!

00:17:05.670 --> 00:17:06.750
Hey, wai-!

00:17:07.170 --> 00:17:10.420
Yes! It's very delicious!

00:17:10.420 --> 00:17:12.000
Huh? It was a success?!

00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:14.250
Not bad, Akiho-chan!

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:16.750
I will also conquer this challenge!

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:18.960
Kosaka-san...

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:20.710
You really made an effort, huh?

00:17:24.380 --> 00:17:25.500
Saijo-san?

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:27.750
Haruka... kun...

00:17:28.420 --> 00:17:34.750
Please, keep my condition... a secret...
from Akiho-chan...

00:17:34.750 --> 00:17:36.290
Huh... What?!

00:17:37.960 --> 00:17:40.380
Because... the friendship of maidens...

00:17:40.380 --> 00:17:43.710
is absolute!

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:45.500
Saijo-san?!

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:48.630
SAIJO-SAN!

00:17:48.630 --> 00:17:50.290
Oh yeah!

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:53.250
What did I just...?

00:17:53.500 --> 00:17:55.290
Just pure, white ash...

00:17:55.880 --> 00:17:57.040
Upset.

00:17:57.290 --> 00:17:58.460
Kosaka-san...

00:17:58.880 --> 00:18:01.540
Rina-san collapsed, in all likelihood,

00:18:01.540 --> 00:18:03.420
due to my cooking...

00:18:03.710 --> 00:18:05.880
I assumed that she was okay, but...

00:18:07.880 --> 00:18:12.040
I can't believe I caused my precious friend trouble...

00:18:12.670 --> 00:18:15.290
And it was simply out of spite.

00:18:15.290 --> 00:18:15.920
"Spite?"

00:18:16.170 --> 00:18:17.630
Did something happen?

00:18:18.330 --> 00:18:21.670
Oh! Your steak is delicious!

00:18:22.250 --> 00:18:23.790
It's nothing!

00:18:24.250 --> 00:18:25.460
In any case,

00:18:25.460 --> 00:18:27.920
please let me cook for you again on another day!

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:31.330
And I'll make this into fertilizer for the flowers.

00:18:34.130 --> 00:18:36.790
I really want to eat that lunch box...

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:37.710
Huh?!

00:18:37.830 --> 00:18:39.830
Y-you can't!

00:18:39.830 --> 00:18:42.670
There's no way I will cause you the same trouble!

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:47.130
Being considerate of her boyfriend's body
is also a duty of a girlfriend!

00:18:48.630 --> 00:18:49.710
Okay then...

00:18:50.380 --> 00:18:56.380
What about, "Granting the wish of her boyfriend
is also a duty of a girlfriend"?

00:18:57.210 --> 00:18:58.170
Right?

00:19:00.630 --> 00:19:05.000
I don't understand the circumstances,
but it seems like I'm also at fault...

00:19:05.420 --> 00:19:06.920
And most importantly,

00:19:06.920 --> 00:19:10.710
the fact that you did your best
to make it makes me happy.

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:13.920
B-but, if you eat it, you'll get sick...

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:16.290
If it comes to that, I hope you'll look after me.

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:20.420
Saying that also seems like something
lovers would do and that's good, right?

00:19:20.420 --> 00:19:21.750
Just kidding.

00:19:23.830 --> 00:19:26.630
Please leave it to me...

00:19:27.330 --> 00:19:30.250
I will wholeheartedly take care of you.

00:19:30.460 --> 00:19:31.500
From the top

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:32.500
to the bottom!

00:19:32.500 --> 00:19:34.210
What do you mean 'bottom'?!

00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:37.380
When you can't move,
I'll take care of your bottom, too!

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:39.540
J-just taking care of me normally is okay!

00:19:39.540 --> 00:19:40.830
But your bottom, too!

00:19:41.380 --> 00:19:42.920
Oh, man...

00:19:42.920 --> 00:19:46.130
I made too much.

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:20.960
I think it's about this much.

00:21:21.080 --> 00:21:22.380
You think so?

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:26.460
It has to be around this much.

00:21:26.460 --> 00:21:27.210
Hmm...

00:21:27.210 --> 00:21:29.330
Hrmm...

00:21:29.710 --> 00:21:32.380
What are you two talking about?

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:35.790
Well, you see...

00:21:38.420 --> 00:21:41.540
We're guessing the amount of used tissues you have!

00:21:41.540 --> 00:21:43.290
Why are you doing that...?

00:21:43.290 --> 00:21:45.080
Not that it really matters.

00:21:45.380 --> 00:21:49.000
After all, your trash can must be full of 'em, right?

00:21:49.000 --> 00:21:50.630
Of course not!

00:21:50.920 --> 00:21:54.670
I see, it's too early to come to that conclusion.

00:21:54.670 --> 00:21:55.750
It is, right?

00:21:55.920 --> 00:21:57.080
In his trash can,

00:21:57.080 --> 00:21:58.670
at the very least...

00:21:59.290 --> 00:22:00.500
Silicon pipes!

00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:01.380
Tissues!

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:03.000
Pictures of little girls (crusty ones)!

00:22:03.000 --> 00:22:04.750
A two-piece!

00:22:05.040 --> 00:22:07.420
This is what I suspect is in his trash can!

00:22:07.420 --> 00:22:08.710
You should contradict that!

00:22:08.710 --> 00:22:11.290
And what is this huge percentage in pictures?!

00:22:11.500 --> 00:22:12.790
I've said it over and over again,

00:22:12.790 --> 00:22:14.420
but I'm not a lolicon!

00:22:14.750 --> 00:22:18.420
However, you do have other things
in your room, don't you?

00:22:18.420 --> 00:22:19.080
Ack...

00:22:19.080 --> 00:22:21.710
I-I-I-I don't have things like that!

00:22:21.880 --> 00:22:22.960
I don't!

00:22:22.960 --> 00:22:23.960
I don't.

00:22:23.960 --> 00:22:25.790
I don't...

00:22:25.790 --> 00:22:27.330
You...

00:22:27.330 --> 00:22:28.790
...don't?

00:22:30.250 --> 00:22:31.460
So that means...

00:22:32.080 --> 00:22:34.580
...you fantasize about someone?

00:22:37.080 --> 00:22:39.750
That someone... must be...

00:22:41.080 --> 00:22:43.630
Are they still in doubt about something?

00:22:45.750 --> 00:22:48.380
If you're curious, come over to my room sometime.

00:22:48.580 --> 00:22:49.540
Huh?!

00:22:49.830 --> 00:22:51.500
I'll show you properly.

00:22:51.750 --> 00:22:52.630
What?!

00:22:53.000 --> 00:22:54.460
Just for a good look, okay?

00:22:54.750 --> 00:22:55.790
Show what?

00:22:55.790 --> 00:22:57.380
Show "it"?!

00:23:02.210 --> 00:23:03.750
Shinozaki-san...

00:23:03.750 --> 00:23:05.960
Could this situation possibly be... No!

00:23:05.960 --> 00:23:09.500
Don't get ahead of yourself, Haruka Shinozaki!

00:23:09.500 --> 00:23:11.290
The two of us in bed together

00:23:11.290 --> 00:23:15.330
means the two of us are in bed together and the furniture
that bears the weight of the two of us is a bed

00:23:15.330 --> 00:23:18.250
and since the computer has internet...

00:23:18.250 --> 00:23:20.500
I-it's no good! No matter how I think about it
there's no way out of it!

00:23:20.500 --> 00:23:24.580
The top priority here is
not to embarrass myself in front of her!

00:23:26.000 --> 00:23:27.750
Ko..Kosaka-sa...

00:23:31.080 --> 00:23:32.500
What is this?

00:23:32.500 --> 00:23:34.330
I'm kind of relieved,

00:23:34.330 --> 00:23:36.420
yet kind of disappointed...
